re/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8902_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-13T09:13:10-07:00","id":864984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BenjCano</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/609481-vampire-the-masquerade-4th-edition-announced-at-gencon?p=626145#post626145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Really? The worst of all of them is the official one? Sweet zombie jesus...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I always thought there was some fundamentalist bullshit going on behind that choice, for some reason...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3320-cathakjordi","name":"CathakJordi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3320_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-13T09:25:29-07:00","id":864994,"title":"","content":"Well, to modify your feelings regarding the new direction of V4, the new White Wolf doesn't exactly have a deep bench of authors and developers. While Onyx Path isn't going to be handling the books, a lot of the freelancers in the Onyx Path regular rotations are probably going to be tapped to work on WW's stuff.<br /> <br /> Also, Onyx Path is still going to be retaining the license to produce WoD material via the 20th game lines for at