avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5352_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T06:09:11-07:00","id":873042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GothicWizard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/609481-vampire-the-masquerade-4th-edition-announced-at-gencon?p=872654#post872654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can get some idea of the direction they are heading in V4 by reading the interview we had with Martin, as I asked him several direct questions about where V4 is headed here; <a href=\"http://www.worldofdarkness.news/Articles/TabId/95/ArtMID/501/userid/2/ArticleID/2/WoD-News-interview-with-White-Wolf-Martin-Elricsson.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.worldofdarkness.news/Arti...Elricsson.aspx</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you very much for the link, Gothic... I wouldn't have located this otherwise <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Long time lurker","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8781-happy-hermit","name":"Happy Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8781_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]}